# From original_saves/dutch-campaign/COLONY03.SAV (Netherlands, Spring 1669, turn 246, 32 colonies)
# with every human map unit that had no standing orders (none, go-to, plow, road) sentried
# through sav_json, re-saved once by the port. The human idles five turns: Space ends each turn,
# every end-of-turn popup is answered with its default row (Return), units that wake up are
# sentried again. Covers the late-game Euro AI, native raids, the King's REF additions, market
# drift, colony production and Founding Father election (Jan de Witt joins). Drift guard.
